OL,3,GNEWSAMaternity unit fears prompt call
OL,4,Afor guarantee
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leaders have called on the
OL,7,Fgovernment to guarantee maternity
OL,8,Fservices at a hospital will reopen
OL,9,Fafter NHS leaders warned that smaller
OL,10,Fmaternity units across England could
OL,11,Fface permanent closure.
OL,13,FBirthing services at North Devon
OL,14,FDistrict Hospital's maternity unit have
OL,15,Fbeen suspended since 11 August because
OL,16,Fof staff shortages.
OL,18,FJess Bailey, chair of Devon County
OL,19,FCouncil's health scrutiny committee,
OL,20,Fsaid she was "appalled that closing
OL,21,Fsmaller units including Barnstaple is
OL,22,Fnow on the agenda".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
